# RNNoise neural-network weights -- fetched at build time from
# media.xiph.org (matches xiph upstream `download_model.sh` flow).
# Files are large (~75 MB each); kept out of the repo to keep clone
# size manageable.
src/rnnoise_data.c
src/rnnoise_data.h
src/rnnoise_data_little.c
src/rnnoise_data_little.h

# MSBuild outputs
build/x64/
*.tar.gz

# The repo-root .gitignore's standard VS "build results" x86/ pattern
# blanket-matches this real vendored SIMD source directory too (same
# footgun as opus_dnn/.gitignore -- see its comment for the full story).
# Un-ignore it explicitly; verified empirically that a bare local
# negation (no build/*-style intermediate step needed here, since the
# ignoring pattern lives in a different/parent .gitignore than this one).
!src/x86/
!src/x86/**

# PyTorch model checkpoints (upstream retraining inputs only; not used
# at runtime -- the runtime data lives in src/rnnoise_data*.c/h above).
models/*.pth
